          "path": "_m/g/f/j/2/ochil-hills-wp/unidentified-building-geograph.jpg",
          "filename": "Unidentified building - geograph.org.uk - 687871.jpg",
          "caption": "Unidentified building This ground had a lot of green 'boxes' as well as this building on the ground.  There were no means of identifying the boxes or their purpose - they were all about 4ft x 4ft.  Subsequently I have found that the green 'boxes' are a series of pumps for Highland Spring. They've taken so much water off the hill that officially it's no longer a spring as they have to forcibly pump the water out and then filter all the gubbins out.",
          "alt": "Unidentified building This ground had a lot of green 'boxes' as well as this building on the ground.  There were no means of identifying the boxes or their purpose - they were all about 4ft x 4ft.  Subsequently I have found that the green 'boxes' are a series of pumps for Highland Spring. They've taken so much water off the hill that officially it's no longer a spring as they have to forcibly pump the water out and then filter all the gubbins out.",
          "width": 640,
          "height": 360,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
          "artist": "Calum McRoberts",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Unidentified_building_-_geograph.org.uk_-_687871.jpg",
